<%doc>

=head1 NAME

check_organism.mas - a mason component for displaying message 
related to QTL parental accession submissions not supported by SGN...
=AUTHOR

Isaak Y Tecle (iyt2@cornell.edu)

=cut

</%doc>

<%args>

$species
$cultivar
$guide

</%args>

<%perl>

my $message = qq |<p> SGN 目前似乎不支援此物種(It appears that SGN currently does not support this species) (<b><i>$species</i>$cultivar</b>)。<br/> 
                  首先，請確保您輸入的物種名稱拼寫正確(As a first step, please make sure you have spelled the species correctly)。</p>
                        
                  <p> 也請閱讀提交親本品系時必須使用的命名格式指南(Read also the guidline for the nomenclature format you have to use to submit the parental lines)。</p>

                  <p> 請<a href="javascript:history.go(-1)">返回(back)</a>並檢查。</p>
                        
                  <p> 如果您持續遇到相同的問題，請<a href=mailto:sgn-feedback\@sgn.cornell.edu>聯繫我們(contact us)</a>。</p> 
                 |;


</%perl>

<& /page/page_title.mas, title => '檢查親本種原(Check parental accession(s))' &>
<&| /page/info_section.mas, title => '', subtitle => $guide &>
  <% $message %>  
</&>
